      "writtenOn": "2024-03-22T16:07:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because I checked the logic in btif_dm_search_services_evt and\nbtif_dm_search_devices_evt, and they both do almost same thing.\n\nService search callback just sends name up to Java.\nDevice search callback also looks up CoD and sends it to Java.\n\nService search callback was added recently, and was under a flag, to ensure name is passed, so my guess was they missed CoD when implementing that recently. Therefore I decided device search callback should be preferred.",
